==== Modifications by new-api-sub ====

This directory (web/ui) is a modified version of the new-api frontend
(https://github.com/QuantumNous/new-api, directory web/, commit ba5f736),
copied on 2026-11-04 and licensed under the GNU Affero General Public
License v3.0 (see LICENSE). It is not the original new-api product and is
not endorsed by QuantumNous; it uses its own name and logo.

Summary of changes (AGPLv3 Section 7(c)):
- Built as two applications from one code base: the supplier portal
  ("小蓝号池") and its admin console ("小蓝号池管理后台"), selected with
  APP=portal|admin; per-app entries, routes and menus live in src/apps/.
- Removed features unrelated to these applications (chat, playground,
  wallet, pricing, subscriptions, system settings, setup, OAuth/passkey/2FA
  sign-in, notifications, update checks) and all languages except
  Simplified Chinese and English.
- Replaced token-based authentication with the cookie session of the
  new-api-sub backend (/api/auth/*, /api/me).
- Replaced the logo and favicon.
- Added new pages and shared components for the portal and admin features.

Modified source files carry a "Modified 2026-11-04 by new-api-sub" line
after the original copyright header; new files carry a
"Copyright (C) 2026 new-api-sub contributors" header.
